==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun|sg=[[serial]] [[killer]]}}

# A person who [[commit]]s [[multiple]] (more than two) [[murder]]s, especially [[similar]] ones with no [[obvious]] [[motive]] over a period of time with a "cooling-off" period between each murder.

====Related terms====
* [[mass murderer]]

